+# _sage_pv_fp16_scaled). Measured on the 3090 at Qwen-Image-2.1 shapes (B=1 H=32 D=128 Q=4096 K=4608):
+# fp16 1.46x and fp16+fp32 1.21x faster than the default before the scaling, relative error 0.0119 vs 0.0115.
+SAGE_PV_ACCUM = os.environ.get("COMFY_SAGE_PV_ACCUM", "").strip()
